# Path redirects for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# The apex → www redirect is NOT here: Pages ignores domain-level rules in this
# file. It lives in the Cloudflare dashboard (santharpanaspa.com → Rules →
# Redirect Rules → "Redirect apex to www").
#
# /appoinment (old misspelling) gets a real 301 so its link equity passes to
# /appointment. /description?id=N stays a prerendered noindex shell that
# redirects client-side, because only React can read the id to pick the
# treatment page.

/appoinment   /appointment   301
/appoinment/  /appointment   301
